---
args: { fit: VersionedCategoryFit[], taxonomy: TaxonomyEvolutionRequest }
returns: TaxonomyStructureDiagnosis
---
Group recurring boundary failures by exact examples and missing distinctions. Determine whether better annotation guidance would resolve the fit or whether the current category definition cannot express the observed concept. Preserve a decisive new requirement or high-impact rare concept even when frequency is low; do not split a category for wording variants alone.
